  data: {
    LLM: '1. Reveal: The top card of the Diamond (Prize) pile is turned face-up.\n2. Bid: Both players choose one card from their hand and place it face-down.\n3. Showdown: Both bid cards are revealed simultaneously.\n4. Award: The player with the higher bidding card wins the Diamond card and adds its value to their score.\n5. Discard: Both bidding cards are discarded regardless of who won.',
    Player: '1. Reveal: The top card of the Diamond (Prize) pile is turned face-up.\n2. Bid: Both players choose one card from their hand and place it face-down.\n3. Showdown: Both bid cards are revealed simultaneously.\n4. Award: The player with the higher bidding card wins the Diamond card and adds its value to their score.\n5. Discard: Both bidding cards are discarded regardless of who won.',
    objective: 'Win the most points by capturing the highest-value prize cards (Diamonds).',
    gameplay: '1. Reveal: The top card of the Diamond (Prize) pile is turned face-up.\n2. Bid: Both players choose one card from their hand and place it face-down.\n3. Showdown: Both bid cards are revealed simultaneously.\n4. Award: The player with the higher bidding card wins the Diamond card and adds its value to their score.\n5. Discard: Both bidding cards are discarded regardless of who won.',
    keyRules: [
